     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Use the quotient rule: <span data-math=\"\\frac{{{a^n}}}{{{a^m}}} = {a^{\\left( {n - m} \\right)}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{{b^6}}}{{{b^4}}} = {b^{\\left( {6 - 4} \\right)}} = {b^2}\"></span></p>"
